---
import SiteLayout from '../../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro'; const base=import.meta.env.BASE_URL; const href=(value:string)=>`${base}${value.replace(/^\//,'')}`; const sample={apiVersion:'connectionagent.io/v1alpha1',kind:'FiveGCSimStandaloneConfig',contractVersion:'v1',spec:{process:{listen:'127.0.0.1:8787'},world:{worldRef:'world-standalone',worldGeneration:'g1',seedProfile:'registered-active-pdu-sessions-v1',seedParameters:{supis:['001010000000001','001010000000002'],networkPolicy:{dnn:'internet',sst:1,sd:'000000',pduSessionId:10,fiveQi:9}}}}}; const startCommand='go run ./cmd/ca-5gc-sim serve-standalone --config ./standalone.json --log-level info'; const inspectCommands='curl http://127.0.0.1:8787/identity\ncurl http://127.0.0.1:8787/healthz\ncurl http://127.0.0.1:8787/v1/world';
---
<SiteLayout title="ca-5gc-sim Standalone" lang="zh"><section class="hero"><span class="eyebrow">ca-5gc-sim / Standalone</span><h1>单独启动模拟器</h1><p class="lede"><code>serve-standalone</code> 复用同一套 WorldStore、FactReader、OperationService 与 Owner HTTP API，但不依赖 Sandbox、Service Fabric、Lab 或 Runtime。</p><div class="page-tabs"><a href={href('/components/ca-5gc-sim/')}>概览</a><a href={href('/components/ca-5gc-sim/api/')}>HTTP API</a></div></section><section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">1 / 配置</span><h2>最小 Standalone World</h2></div></div><pre><code>{JSON.stringify(sample,null,2)}</code></pre><p class="source-note">配置结构遵循上游 <code>FiveGCSimStandaloneConfig.v1</code> fixture 与 schema。</p></section><section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">2 / 启动</span><h2>运行本地确定性 Profile</h2></div></div><pre><code>{startCommand}</code></pre><p>启动成功后会进入 <code>READY</code>，并打印 listen 地址、world 与 generation。Standalone 的 listen 地址应配置为 loopback。</p></section><section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">3 / 查看</span><h2>使用同一套 Owner API</h2></div></div><pre><code>{inspectCommands}</code></pre><div class="notice">Standalone 用于确定性的本地执行验证。它不能替代 Service Fabric 的交付行为、Network Observation、drop/delay/reorder 故障、response-loss 以及集成可靠性场景验证。</div></section></SiteLayout>